{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q002", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_nobel_prize", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இரவீந்திரநாத் தாகூருக்கு எந்த ஆண்டு, எந்த இலக்கியப் படைப்பிற்காக இலக்கியத்திற்கான நோபல் பரிசு வழங்கப்பட்டது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1911 - கோரா", "B": "1913 - கீதாஞ்சலி (Gitanjali)", "C": "1915 - தபால் நிலையம் (The Post Office)", "D": "1919 - காபூலிவாலா"}, "explanation": "1913-ஆம் ஆண்டு தாகூரின் புகழ்பெற்ற கவிதைத் தொகுப்பான 'கீதாஞ்சலி'க்கு ஆசியாவிலேயே முதன்முதலாக இலக்கியத்திற்கான நோபல் பரிசு வழங்கப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which year and for which seminal literary work was Rabindranath Tagore awarded the Nobel Prize in Literature?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1911 - Gora", "B": "1913 - Gitanjali (Song Offerings)", "C": "1915 - The Post Office", "D": "1919 - Kabuliwala"}, "explanation": "Tagore won the Nobel Prize in Literature in 1913 for his poetry collection Gitanjali."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q003", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "shantiniketan_philosophy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாகூர் தோற்றுவித்த 'சாந்திநிகேதன்' மற்றும் 'விஸ்வபாரதி' கல்வி நிறுவனங்களின் மையக் கல்விக் கோட்பாடாக விளங்கியது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுவர் சூழ்ந்த வகுப்பறை மனப்பாடக் கல்வி", "B": "அரசுப் பணிக்கான ஆங்கில வழிப் பயிற்சி முறை மட்டுமே", "C": "இயற்கையோடு இயைந்த திறந்தவெளிக் கல்வி மற்றும் உலகளாவிய மனிதநேயக் கலை வளர்ச்சி", "D": "தொழிற்கல்வி மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "சுவர்கள் இல்லாத மரத்தடி நிழலில், இயற்கையோடு ஒன்றிணைந்து கற்பதும், அனைத்து நாட்டுப் பண்பாடுகளையும் மதிக்கும் உலகளாவிய மனிதநேயமுமே தாகூரின் சாந்திநிகேதன் கோட்பாடாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the foundational educational philosophy underpinning Tagore's 'Shantiniketan' and 'Visva-Bharati'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Enclosed classroom rote memorization", "B": "Exclusive English instruction geared toward colonial administration", "C": "Open-air learning harmonized with pristine nature fostering universal humanist aesthetics", "D": "Exclusively vocational training"}, "explanation": "Tagore championed communion with nature and broad humanist education over artificial institutional boundaries."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 177, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 177", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q004", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_nature_observation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இந்திரா தேவிக்கு எழுதிய கடிதத்தில், இயற்கையின் எத்தகைய அழகை விவரிக்கும் போது தாகூர் 'பூமியின் மடியில் ஓடும் ஆறு தாயின் மடியில் தவழும் குழந்தை போல இருக்கிறது' என்று உருவகிக்கிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கங்கை ஆறு", "B": "யமுனை ஆறு", "C": "பிரம்மபுத்திரா ஆறு", "D": "பத்மா ஆறு (வங்கதேசத்தில் பாயும் பகுதி)"}, "explanation": "வங்கதேசத்தின் பத்மா நதியில் படகில் தங்கிப் பயணம் செய்தபோது எழுதிய கடிதங்களில் அந்நதியின் வனப்பையும் இயற்கை மாற்றங்களையும் தாகூர் மிக நெகிழ்ச்சியுடன் வர்ணிக்கிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "During his boat journeys on which river did Tagore compose exquisite letters likening the meandering river to an infant upon Mother Earth's lap?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ganges", "B": "Yamuna", "C": "Brahmaputra", "D": "River Padma (in rural Bengal)"}, "explanation": "Tagore stayed on a houseboat on the Padma River, which deeply inspired his literary meditations."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 177, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 177", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q005", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "visva_bharati_motto", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாகூரால் தொடங்கப்பட்ட 'விஸ்வபாரதி' பல்கலைக்கழகத்தின் இலச்சினையில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள சமஸ்கிருதக் குறிக்கோள் வாசகம் (Motto) எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "யத்ர விஸ்வம் பவத்யேக நீடம் (Yatra Visvam Bhavatyeka Needam - இவ்வுலகம் ஒரே கூடாக மாறும் இடம்)", "B": "சத்யமேவ ஜெயதே", "C": "தமஸோமா ஜோதிர்கமய", "D": "அஹிம்சா பரமோ தர்மஹ"}, "explanation": "'யத்ர விஸ்வம் பவத்யேக நீடம்' (எங்கே உலகம் ஒரு பறவைக் கூடாக மாறுகிறதோ) என்பதே விஸ்வபாரதி பல்கலைக்கழகத்தின் குறிக்கோள் வாசகமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the Upanishadic motto inscribed upon the emblem of Tagore's Visva-Bharati University?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Yatra Visvam Bhavatyeka Needam (Where the whole world meets in a single nest)", "B": "Satyameva Jayate", "C": "Tamaso Ma Jyotirgamaya", "D": "Ahimsa Paramo Dharmah"}, "explanation": "'Yatra Visvam Bhavatyeka Needam' represents the universal sanctuary ethos of Visva-Bharati."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q006", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_knighthood_renunciation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆங்கிலேய அரசு தாகூருக்கு வழங்கிய 'சர்' (Knighthood) பட்டத்தை அவர் எந்த வரலாற்று நிகழ்விற்கு எதிர்ப்பு தெரிவித்துத் துறந்தார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வங்கப் பிரிவினை (1905)", "B": "ஜாலியன் வாலாபாக் படுகொலை (1919)", "C": "சௌரி சௌரா நிகழ்வு (1922)", "D": "உப்புச் சத்தியாகிரகம் (1930)"}, "explanation": "1919-ல் நடைபெற்ற கொடூரமான ஜாலியன் வாலாபாக் படுகொலையைக் கண்டித்து, ஆங்கிலேய வைஸ்ராய்க்குத் தாகூர் கடும் கடிதம் எழுதித் தமக்கு வழங்கப்பட்ட 'சர்' பட்டத்தைத் துறந்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In protest against which horrific colonial atrocity did Rabindranath Tagore renounce his British Knighthood in 1919?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Partition of Bengal (1905)", "B": "Jallianwala Bagh Massacre (1919)", "C": "Chauri Chaura incident (1922)", "D": "Salt Satyagraha (1930)"}, "explanation": "Tagore renounced his Knighthood following the brutal massacre at Jallianwala Bagh in 1919."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q007", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_two_anthems", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இரண்டு நாடுகளின் தேசிய கீதங்களை இயற்றிய தனிப்பெரும் பெருமை தாகூருக்கு உண்டு. அந்த இரு நாடுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இந்தியா மற்றும் இலங்கை", "B": "இந்தியா மற்றும் நேபாளம்", "C": "இந்தியா (ஜன கண மன) மற்றும் வங்கதேசம் (அமர் சோனார் பங்களா)", "D": "இந்தியா மற்றும் பூடான்"}, "explanation": "தாகூர் இயற்றிய 'ஜன கண மன' இந்தியாவின் தேசிய கீதமாகவும், 'அமர் சோனார் பங்களா' வங்கதேசத்தின் தேசிய கீதமாகவும் ஏற்கப்பட்டுள்ளன (இலங்கை தேசிய கீதத்திற்கும் இவரது மெட்டே அடிப்படையாக அமைந்தது)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tagore holds the unique historic distinction of having composed national anthems for which two sovereign nations?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "India and Sri Lanka", "B": "India and Nepal", "C": "India (Jana Gana Mana) and Bangladesh (Amar Shonar Bangla)", "D": "India and Bhutan"}, "explanation": "Tagore composed Jana Gana Mana for India and Amar Shonar Bangla for Bangladesh."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q008", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_letters_tamil_translator", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடப்பகுதியில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள தாகூரின் கடிதங்களைத் தமிழில் மொழிபெயர்த்தவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "க. நா. சுப்ரமண்யம்", "B": "வ. ரா.", "C": "அ. வேங்கடாசலம் பிள்ளை", "D": "தா. நா. குமாரசுவாமி"}, "explanation": "வங்க மொழியிலிருந்து தாகூரின் கடிதங்கள் மற்றும் படைப்புகளைத் தமிழில் அழகுற மொழிபெயர்த்த பெருமைக்குரியவர் மொழிபெயர்ப்பாளர் தா. நா. குமாரசுவாமி ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who rendered Tagore's Bengali letters into graceful Tamil as featured in the Class 11 textbook?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ka. Naa. Subramanyam", "B": "Va. Raa.", "C": "A. Venkatachalam Pillai", "D": "T. N. Kumaraswamy"}, "explanation": "T. N. Kumaraswamy masterfully translated Tagore's letters from Bengali to Tamil."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 176, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 176", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q009", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_nature_concept", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"பருவங்களின் மாற்றத்தைக் காணாத மனிதன் தன் வாழ்க்கையின் மிகப்பெரிய இன்பத்தை இழந்துவிடுகிறான்\" - தாகூரின் இக்கருத்து எதனை உணர்த்துகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இயற்கையோடு இணைந்து வாழும் வாழ்வே முழுமையான மன அமைதியையும் ஆன்ம விடுதலையையும் தரும்", "B": "நகர வாழ்க்கை மட்டுமே சிறந்தது", "C": "பருவமழை மட்டுமே மனிதனுக்குத் தேவை", "D": "இயற்கையை மனிதன் தன் விருப்பப்படி அழிக்கலாம்"}, "explanation": "பருவங்களின் சுழற்சியும் இயற்கையின் மாற்றங்களும் மனித மனதிற்கு அளப்பரிய அழகியல் உணர்வையும் ஆன்ம விடுதலையையும் தருகின்றன என்பது தாகூரின் ஆழ்ந்த தத்துவமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What core philosophy is highlighted by Tagore's reflection that one who misses the shifting seasons misses life's sublime joy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Living in intimate harmony with nature grants spiritual tranquility and holistic liberation", "B": "Only urban existence is commendable", "C": "Only monsoons matter", "D": "Nature can be exploited at will"}, "explanation": "Tagore believed that communion with seasonal natural rhythms is fundamental to human consciousness."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 176, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 176", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q010", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_music_genre", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இரவீந்திரநாத் தாகூரால் உருவாக்கப்பட்ட தனித்துவமான இசைப் பாணி இந்தியாவில் எவ்வாறு அழைக்கப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஹிந்துஸ்தானி செவ்வியல்", "B": "இரவீந்திர சங்கீதம் (Rabindra Sangeet)", "C": "பௌல் இசை", "D": "துமிரி"}, "explanation": "தாகூர் இரண்டாயிரத்திற்கும் மேற்பட்ட பாடல்களை எழுதித் தாமே மெட்டமைத்தார்; இந்நாட்டுப்புற-செவ்வியல் கலந்த இசை மரபு 'இரவீந்திர சங்கீதம்' என்று அழைக்கப்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What distinctive genre of music originated by Rabindranath Tagore forms an integral cultural treasure of India?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Hindustani Classical", "B": "Rabindra Sangeet", "C": "Baul Folk", "D": "Thumri"}, "explanation": "Rabindra Sangeet encompasses over 2,000 lyrical melodies composed by Tagore."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q011", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "indira_devi_musical_role", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாகூரின் கடிதங்களைப் பெற்ற இந்திரா தேவி தாகூரின் படைப்புலகில் ஆற்றிய முதன்மையான பங்களிப்பு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அவரது நாடகங்களில் முதன்மை வேடமிட்டு நடித்தார்", "B": "அவரது பள்ளியின் தலைமை ஆசிரியையாகப் பணியாற்றினார்", "C": "தாகூர் இயற்றிய பாடல்களுக்கு சுவரக்குறிப்புகள் (Notation) எழுதி இரவீந்திர சங்கீதத்தைப் பாதுகாத்துப் பரப்பினார்", "D": "கீதாஞ்சலியை ஆங்கிலத்தில் மொழிபெயர்த்தார்"}, "explanation": "இந்திரா தேவி சிறந்த இசை ஞானம் கொண்டவர்; தாகூர் பாடிய பல பாடல்களுக்கு முறைப்படி இசைக்குறிப்புகளை (Swaralipi) எழுதி வைத்தவர் இவரே."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What cardinal contribution did recipient Indira Devi make toward preserving Tagore's artistic legacy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Acted as principal heroine in his plays", "B": "Served as headmistress of his school", "C": "Transcribed musical notations (swaralipi) for his compositions, systematizing Rabindra Sangeet", "D": "Translated Gitanjali into English"}, "explanation": "Indira Devi documented notations for countless songs, establishing the textual archive of Rabindra Sangeet."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 176, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 176", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q012", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_painting_age", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாகூர் தம்முடைய வாழ்வின் பிற்பகுதியில், ஏறத்தாழ எந்த வயதில் ஓவியங்கள் வரையத் தொடங்கி ஆயிரக்கணக்கான நவீன ஓவியங்களைப் படைத்தார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "25 வயதில்", "B": "40 வயதில்", "C": "50 வயதில்", "D": "68-70 வயதில்"}, "explanation": "தாகூர் தம்முடைய 68-70 வயதில் ஓவியக் கலையில் தீவிரமாக இறங்கி, நவீன பாணியில் மூவாயிரத்திற்கும் மேற்பட்ட உலகத்தரம் வாய்ந்த ஓவியங்களை வரைந்து தள்ளினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "At what remarkably advanced age did Tagore plunge into painting, producing thousands of modern avant-garde artworks?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "At age 25", "B": "At age 40", "C": "At age 50", "D": "Around age 68-70"}, "explanation": "Tagore began his acclaimed painterly oeuvre late in life, around his late sixties."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 