{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q022", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_chinnapatra_letters", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாகூர் இந்திரா தேவிக்கு எழுதிய கடிதங்கள் வங்க மொழியில் எவ்வாறு நூல் வடிவில் தொகுக்கப்பட்டு வெளியிடப்பட்டுள்ளன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கீதாஞ்சலி", "B": "சின்னபத்ரா (Chhinnapatra / கிழிந்த கடிதங்கள்)", "C": "சாந்திநிகேதன் கட்டுரைகள்", "D": "கல்பனா"}, "explanation": "இந்திரா தேவிக்குப் பல ஆண்டுகளாகத் தாகூர் எழுதிய கடிதங்கள் வங்க மொழியில் 'சின்னபத்ரா' (Chhinnapatra) என்ற பெயரில் தொகுக்கப்பட்டு உலகப் புகழ்பெற்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Under what title was Tagore's collection of letters to Indira Devi published in Bengali literature?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Gitanjali", "B": "Chhinnapatra (Torn Leaves)", "C": "Shantiniketan Essays", "D": "Kalpana"}, "explanation": "The letters to Indira Devi are anthologized as Chhinnapatra, a masterpiece of Bengali epistolary literature."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 176, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 176", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q023", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_literature_types", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாகூரின் இலக்கியப் பங்களிப்பில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள துறைகளுள் பொருந்தாத ஒன்றைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்க:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கவிதைகள் மற்றும் பாடல்கள்", "B": "சிறுகதைகள், புதினங்கள், நாடகங்கள்", "C": "மந்திர தந்திர நூல்கள்", "D": "கட்டுரைகள், ஓவியங்கள், கடிதங்கள்"}, "explanation": "தாகூர் கவிதை, சிறுகதை, புதினம், நாடகம், கட்டுரை, ஓவியம், இசை ஆகிய அனைத்துத் துறைகளிலும் மேதையாகத் திகழ்ந்தார்; மூடநம்பிக்கை சார்ந்த நூல்களை அவர் ஒருபோதும் ஆதரிக்கவில்லை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following does NOT represent Tagore's multifaceted intellectual and artistic oeuvre?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Poetry and musical compositions", "B": "Short stories, novels, dramas", "C": "Occult incantation manuals", "D": "Essays, modern paintings, literary letters"}, "explanation": "Tagore was an enlightened rational humanist who vehemently opposed occult obscurantism."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Tagore"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q024", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "prose_tagore_letters", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_universal_humanism", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாகூரின் ஒட்டுமொத்தக் கடிதங்கள் மற்றும் கல்விச் சிந்தனைகளின் அடிநாதமாக விளங்கும் உலகளாவிய தத்துவம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குறுகிய தேசியவாதம்", "B": "பொருள்முதல்வாத ஆதிக்கம்", "C": "எல்லைகளைக் கடந்து போரிடுதல்", "D": "எல்லைகள் நீத்த உலகளாவிய மனிதநேயம் (Universal Humanism)"}, "explanation": "இயல் 8-ன் கருப்பொருளான 'எல்லைகள் நீத்த மனிதநேயம்' என்பதற்கேற்ப, நாடு, இனம், மொழி கடந்த உலகளாவிய மனிதநேயமே தாகூரின் எழுத்துகளின் உயிரோட்டமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What universal philosophical outlook permeates Tagore's epistolary prose and educational paradigms?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Chauvinistic sectarian nationalism", "B": "Ruthless consumer materialism", "C": "Expansionist militarism", "D": "Universal Humanism transcending geopolitical borders"}, "explanation": "Universal humanism beyond borders constitutes the core thematic pillar of Tagore's thought."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services