{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q071", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "poetry_manonmaniyam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "manonmaniyam_western_influence", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மனோன்மணீயம் நூலில் காணலாகும் மேலைநாட்டு நாடக மரபின் தாக்கம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாடல்களே இல்லாமல் உரைநடையாக்குதல்", "B": "அங்கங்கள் மற்றும் களங்களின்றித் தொடர் கதையாக எழுதுதல்", "C": "ஐந்து அங்க அமைப்பு, நாடக முரண், தனிமொழி (Soliloquy), பக்கமொழி (Aside) போன்ற உத்திகள் கையாளப்பட்டிருப்பது", "D": "கிரேக்கக் கடவுளர்களைப் பாடுவது"}, "explanation": "ஷேக்ஸ்பியரின் நாடக உத்திகளான Soliloquy (தனிமொழி), Aside (பக்கமொழி) மற்றும் 5 Acts கட்டமைப்பு ஆகியவை சுந்தரனாரால் மிக அழகாகத் தமிழ் மரபுக்கேற்பக் கையாளப்பட்டுள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Western dramatic conventions were ingeniously synthesized into Tamil poetics by Sundaranar in Manonmaniyam?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Dispensing with poetry completely", "B": "Writing undivided prose chapters", "C": "Five-act architecture, dramatic irony, soliloquies, and asides adapted into indigenous idiom", "D": "Invoking Greek Olympian deities"}, "explanation": "Sundaranar incorporated Elizabethan structural conventions including soliloquies, asides, and five-act progressions."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 182, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 182", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Poetry", "Manonmaniyam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q072", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "poetry_manonmaniyam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kudilan_name_etymology", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சுந்தரனார் தம்முடைய வில்லன் பாத்திரத்திற்கு அமைத்த 'குடிலன்' என்ற சொல்லின் சொற்பொருள் மற்றும் குறியீட்டு நயம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குடிலில் வாழ்பவன்", "B": "குடை பிடிப்பவன்", "C": "குடிப்பெருமை உடையவன்", "D": "வளைந்த நெஞ்சம் உடையவன் / வஞ்சகன் (குடிலம் = வளைவு, கோணல் புத்தி)"}, "explanation": "'குடிலம்' என்றால் வளைவு, கோணல் நெறி என்று பொருள். நேர்மையற்ற கோணல் புத்தியும் வஞ்சகமும் கொண்டவன் என்பதால் அக்குணத்திற்கேற்பக் 'குடிலன்' எனப் பெயரிட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the semantic and symbolic etymology of the antagonist name 'Kudilan' coined by Sundaranar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "One who dwells in a humble hut", "B": "Bearer of the royal umbrella", "C": "Of noble lineage", "D": "Crooked of heart / Deceitful manipulator (Kudilam = crooked, deceitful mind)"}, "explanation": "In classical lexicography, 'Kudilam' denotes crookedness, symbolizing Kudilan's deformed moral compass."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 180, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 180", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Poetry", "Manonmaniyam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q073", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "poetry_manonmaniyam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "baladevan_confession", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குடிலனின் மகன் பலதேவன் இறுதியில் எதனால் நிலைகுலைந்து தன் தந்தையின் சதியை ஒப்புக்கொள்கிறான்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நடராசனின் நேரடி விசாரணையாலும், தான் மாட்டிக்கொண்டோம் என்ற அச்சத்தாலும், மனசாட்சியின் உறுத்தலாலும்", "B": "மன்னன் பொற்காசு கொடுத்ததால்", "C": "வாணி மிரட்டியதால்", "D": "சேர மன்னன் நாடு கடத்தியதால்"}, "explanation": "பலதேவன் தன் தந்தையின் திட்டங்கள் சிதைந்ததையும், சான்றுகள் தமக்கு எதிராக இருப்பதையும் கண்டு நிலைகுலைந்து உண்மைகளை ஒப்புக்கொள்கிறான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Why does Baladevan ultimately collapse under interrogation and confess to the conspiracy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Confronted by Natarasan irrefutable proofs, terror of impending retribution, and inner guilt", "B": "Bribed by royal gold", "C": "Intimidated by Vaani", "D": "Exiled by the Cheras"}, "explanation": "Cornered by undeniable documentary evidence and fear of execution, Baladevan breaks down in confession."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 8", "Poetry", "Manonmaniyam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q074", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "poetry_manonmaniyam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "manonmaniyam_praise_kavimani", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"மனோன்மணீயத்தைப் படித்தோர் அதன் சுவையில் தம்மை மறந்து திளைப்பர்\" என்று மனோன்மணீய நாடகத்தைப் போற்றிய கவிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாரதியார்", "B": "கவிமணி தேசிக விநாயகம் பிள்ளை", "C": "நாமக்கல் கவிஞர்", "D": "கண்ணதாசன்"}, "explanation": "சுந்தரனாரின் தத்துவ, நாடகப் புலமையைப் பாராட்டி அவர்தம் ஊரைச் சேர்ந்த கவிமணி தேசிக விநாயகம் பிள்ளை நெஞ்சாரப் புகழ்ந்துள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which celebrated poet extolled Manonmaniyam, affirming that readers become rapturously immersed in its exquisite poetic flavor?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Subramania Bharati", "B": "Kavimani Desigavinayagam Pillai", "C": "Namakkal Kavignar", "D": "Kannadasan"}, "explanation": "Kavimani Desigavinayagam Pillai paid glowing tributes to the timeless aesthetic sweetness of Manonmaniyam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 182, "ch