{"id": "11th_tamil_u8_q114", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "supplementary_narthaki_nataraj", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "narthaki_padma_shri_year", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இந்திய அரசின் மிக உயரிய 'பத்மஸ்ரீ' (Padma Shri) விருதைப் பெற்ற இந்தியாவின் முதல் திருநங்கை என்ற வரலாற்றுப் பெருமையைப் பெற்றவர் யார்? எந்த ஆண்டு?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ரேவதி (2015)", "B": "நர்த்தகி நடராஜ் (2019-ஆம் ஆண்டு)", "C": "பிரியகா பாபு (2018)", "D": "லிவிங் ஸ்மைல் வித்யா (2020)"}, "explanation": "2019-ஆம் ஆண்டு மத்திய அரசால் நர்த்தகி நடராஜ் அவர்களுக்குப் 'பத்மஸ்ரீ' விருது வழங்கப்பட்டது; இவ்விருதைப் பெற்ற முதல் திருநங்கை இவரே."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who etched her name in history as the first transgender woman to be conferred India's prestigious Padma Shri award, and in which year?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Revathi (2015)", "B": "Narthaki Nataraj (in 2019)", "C": "Priyaka Babu (2018)", "D": "Living Smile Vidya (2020)"}, "explanation": "Narthaki Nataraj received the Padma Shri in 2019, making history as the first transgender recipient."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corp